return [
'about' => ['title' => 'A little learning. A bigger future.','eyebrow' => 'ABOUT LEARNOW','intro' => 'Learnow helps people turn an interest in technology into practical, demonstrable skills.','sections' => [['A clearer way forward','We believe learning is easier to sustain when you can see your next step. Guided paths connect focused lessons with practical work, thoughtful assessment and a portfolio that belongs to you.'],['Built around real progress','Opening a page is not the same as learning. Learnow tracks completed activities, server-graded knowledge checks and reviewed assignments. Rewards recognise recorded progress rather than replace it.'],['Your pace, your path','Choose a manageable daily goal, make a schedule that fits your life and adjust it as you grow. Recommendations follow your selected interests and experience; they are rules-based, not an AI service.']]],
'help' => ['title' => 'A little help goes a long way.','eyebrow' => 'HELP & SUPPORT','intro' => 'Here are a few useful places to start.','sections' => [['How do I start a learning path?','Create an account, choose your interests in onboarding and enrol in a published path. Open its learning map to see the first available stage. If a stage is locked, its requirements are shown on the map.'],['What counts towards my daily goal?','Completing a lesson earns learning credit based on its estimated duration. A first quiz pass earns five minutes of credit; an accepted assignment earns twenty. These are goal credits, not a measurement of time spent with a browser tab open. Reach your saved daily target to qualify for a streak day in your chosen timezone.'],['Why can’t I complete a lesson?','A lesson may require all checklist items, a passed quiz or an accepted assignment. Finish the listed requirements first. A page visit alone does not complete a lesson.'],['How are assignments reviewed?','Submit your work using the allowed text, URL or file options. An authorised reviewer can provide feedback, request a revision, grade or accept it. Only accepted work meeting the required score earns completion credit.'],['How do I recover my password?','Use Forgot password on the sign-in page. Password recovery requires configured email delivery. If this installation has not configured SMTP, contact its administrator; the platform will not claim a reset email was sent.'],['How do I report a problem?','Use the reporting form in Community for conduct concerns. For account or technical issues, visit Contact. Do not include passwords, tokens or other secrets in your message.']]],
'contact' => ['title' => 'Let’s get you moving again.','eyebrow' => 'CONTACT','intro' => 'Questions about your learning, account or the platform? Start with the help centre or contact the administrator of this installation.','sections' => [['Account and technical support','The platform’s support email appears below when configured by its administrator. No message is sent by simply visiting this page.'],['Assignment feedback','Open your assignment to read reviewer feedback or submit a requested revision. Project peer reviews are constructive feedback, not official assignment approvals.'],['Community concerns','Use the report and block controls in Community. Moderators can review reports and hide inappropriate feedback.']]],
'privacy' => ['title' => 'Your learning. Your privacy.','eyebrow' => 'PRIVACY NOTICE','intro' => 'This notice describes the data used by this Learnow installation. The operator must supply its legal identity, contact details, retention periods and applicable jurisdiction before a public production launch.','sections' => [['Information stored','The platform stores account details, password hashes, interests, goals, timezone, schedules, learning progress, assessment responses, submitted work, rewards and notifications. Security records include authentication sessions, hashed one-time tokens, rate-limit buckets and administrative audit entries. Passwords are not stored in plain text.'],['Private by default','Lesson notes are private to the learner. Portfolio projects start as private and become publicly accessible only when you publish them. Requesting a peer review shares a snapshot of the selected project with assigned eligible reviewers. Do not include personal research data without permission.'],['Public records you choose or earn','Published portfolio projects and certificate verification pages can be viewed by anyone with their URLs. Certificates show the learner’s name, course title, issue date, identifier and validity status. Think carefully before sharing links.'],['Cookies and outside services','Essential HttpOnly cookies support authentication and CSRF protection. This build does not include advertising trackers. YouTube content is loaded through the official privacy-enhanced embed when a lesson has a configured video; using the player is also subject to YouTube’s policies. SMTP email is used only when configured by the operator.'],['Access, correction and deletion requests','You can update your profile and learning preferences in Settings and remove your portfolio projects. Contact the installation’s operator for account access, export or deletion requests. Retention and lawful obligations must be defined by that operator.'],['Security and limits','The application uses signed, expiring tokens, server-side access controls and secured upload storage. No software can guarantee perfect security. Report suspected issues privately to the operator and do not send passwords or authentication tokens.']]],
 'terms' => ['title' => 'A good foundation for learning.','eyebrow' => 'TERMS OF SERVICE','intro' => 'These starter terms explain the platform’s intended use. The operator must review them for its legal identity, audience and jurisdiction before a public production launch.','sections' => [['Your account','Provide accurate registration information, keep your sign-in details private and use the service lawfully. Do not share accounts, impersonate others or attempt to gain unauthorised access to private learning records.'],['Educational content','Learning material is offered for education. Availability and curriculum may change. Completing a path or receiving a certificate records the platform’s requirements; it is not a promise of employment, income, professional licensing or external accreditation.'],['Your work','Submit work you created or have permission to share. You retain ownership of your original work. Publishing a portfolio project makes it accessible to the public; requesting review shares it with assigned reviewers. Do not upload executable files, malware, secrets or unauthorised copyrighted material.'],['Fair rewards','XP, levels, streak protections and virtual coins have no cash value in this version. Rewards follow administrator-configured eligibility rules. Do not manipulate activity, create fraudulent referrals or exploit repeated requests. Cash rewards and paid features require separate legitimate arrangements.'],['Conduct and moderation','Be constructive and respectful. The operator may moderate abusive content, restrict accounts, correct recorded progress or revoke a certificate when justified. Administrative actions are recorded in the audit log.'],['Availability and support','This application does not promise uninterrupted availability. External services work only when configured, and the platform should not claim delivery when they are unavailable. Contact the operator with account and service questions.']]],
'guidelines' => ['title' => 'Make this a good place to grow.','eyebrow' => 'COMMUNITY GUIDELINES','intro' => 'A little encouragement and specific feedback can help someone take their next step.','sections' => [['Be constructive','Talk about the work, not the worth of the person. Explain what you noticed, why it matters and one practical improvement. Make room for beginners and different experiences.'],['Respect boundaries','Do not expose private notes, submission details or personal information. Ask before sharing someone else’s work. A study buddy connection does not grant access to private learning records.'],['Share honestly','Describe your own contribution, credit collaborators and distinguish practice data from real results. Do not fabricate outcomes, credentials, completed assignments or reviewer approval.'],['Keep it safe','Harassment, threats, discrimination, impersonation, spam and malicious links are not welcome. Use report and block controls when needed. Moderators can investigate reports and hide inappropriate feedback.'],['Remember the purpose','Peer reviews help improve a project. They are not a substitute for the official assignment review process and do not automatically grant approval, XP or a certificate.']]]
